WEBVTT

00:07:28.708 --> 00:07:31.934
on having a legitimate
rationale to back them up.

00:07:31.958 --> 00:07:34.476
Grace had done her homework
on the numbers.

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:36.768
GS: I did a lot of research,

00:07:36.792 --> 00:07:43.726
also kind of talked about why getting
a higher rate was important for me.

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:45.893
It's sometimes in your best interest

00:07:45.917 --> 00:07:48.893
to communicate information
and come to the table

00:07:48.917 --> 00:07:52.226
with information
that you're willing to share.

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:55.934
AG: Grace didn't just succeed
in getting the top of her salary range,

00:07:55.958 --> 00:07:58.351
she also negotiated fewer hours

00:07:58.375 --> 00:08:01.292
and a broader role
that served her manager's needs, too.